18:T441,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is CIMEA the same as a Declaration of Value?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. They are different qualification-information routes. The university or competent authority decides which evidence it accepts or requires."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do all Italian universities require CIMEA?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Requirements vary by university, programme, qualification country and stage of enrolment. Read the exact current instructions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I order CIMEA before admission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only when the university says it is required at that stage or the processing timeline makes early action necessary. Confirm the exact service first."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a Declaration of Value guarantee recognition?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It supplies information about a foreign qualification; the receiving institution makes the relevant academic decision."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cimea-vs-declaration-of-value-italy/\",\"name\":\"CIMEA vs Declaration of Value for studying in Italy\",\"description\":\"Compare CIMEA statements and a consular Declaration of Value. Check issuer, purpose, university acceptance and timing before ordering documents.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cimea-vs-declaration-of-value-italy/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-02\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-28\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/programme-research-editorial.webp\",\"caption\":\"Students working through progra